  message: "RELATED FINDING 2026-10-15 (architect review, not yet investigated): the profile counts vendored tree-sitter-lean's 305,712-line generated parser.c in LOC (324,161 C LOC in the 2026-10-14 self-sketch, 25.7% of counted LOC) although that file contributes NO nodes to the survey. Why it yields no nodes is unknown (size cap? parse failure? intended?). Only lean's parser.c carries an @generated header; circom's and wolfram's do not, so a header-based tier-4 rule would miss two of three. The language-line half is now WI-kojul (summaries count tiers 1-2 only); this item keeps the tier-4 question and the parse cost."  # a6a9
